\section{\code{unlinks}}{

An \code{sf} data frame with one row per unlink: a place where two axial lines cross without being connected.
\describe{
\item{\code{axial_id_1}, \code{axial_id_2}}{integer, the identifiers of the two axial lines that cross without connecting.}
